/E (If SQL is built by joining strings, a quote in the station name can break the query or change its meaning. Parameterised queries keep values separate from SQL commands. For n inserted rows, executemany and execute-in-a-loop both have O\(n\) overall insertion work. executemany generally reduces the number of Python-to-database calls and is preferred for bulk insertion. A supplied batch occupies O\(n\) memory; inserting one row at a time can use O\(1\) extra row memory. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
