/E (Create an index on the combined station and day columns. This helps SQLite locate records fora query that filters by station and date. Measure the slowest query before creating the index, create the index, then repeat the same query with the same parameters and data. Run repeated trials andcompare median times. On a very smalltable the index may show little benefit because setup and measurement overheadare large; the effect is usually clearer ona larger table. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
